# Lab

Follow [lab/AGENTS.md](../../lab/AGENTS.md).

- `lab/spikes/` — informal exploration. No prior hypothesis.
- `lab/campaigns/<slug>/` — bounded research program. Copy `lab/templates/campaign/`. If that template is absent, stop and report the missing path. Do not use the template path as a live campaign.
- Runtime worktrees and bulky artifacts live in `ignored/research/<slug>/`.
- Do not start a campaign run without a sealed evaluator and an explicit budget.
- Do not run `git reset --hard` to reject a candidate.
- Do not promote lab work into `src/` without human review.
